{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1791935175","published":"2026-10-13T23:46:27Z","modified":"2026-11-27T16:30:14.669779223Z","upstream":["CVE-2025-11561","CVE-2026-14474","CVE-2026-14476"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2025-11561, CVE-2026-14474, CVE-2026-14476","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: Path traversal in the AD GPO provider allows writing\n     files outside the GPO cache directory as root\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-14476.patch: reject \"..\" components of\n       gPCFileSysPath in ad_gpo_extract_smb_components() in\n       src/providers/ad/ad_gpo.c and check that the resolved cache path\n       stays inside GPO_CACHE_PATH in gpo_cache_store_file() in\n       src/providers/ad/ad_gpo_child.c\n     - CVE-2026-14476\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: Unrestricted LDAP sudo search base allows injecting\n     sudoRole objects granting root privileges\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-14474.patch: warn when ldap_sudo_search_base\n       is not set and the whole directory tree is searched in\n       sdap_set_config_options_with_rootdse() in src/providers/ldap/sdap.c\n     - CVE-2026-14474\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: Privilege escalation via the Kerberos an2ln localauth\n     fallback on AD/IPA clients\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-11561.patch: disable the an2ln localauth\n       plugin in the SSSD localauth plugin configuration snippet in\n       src/util/domain_info_utils.c\n     - CVE-2025-11561","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libipa-hbac-dev","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libipa-hbac-dev?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.4.1-2+deb11u1+tuxcare.els3"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1791935175.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libipa-hbac0","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libipa-hbac0?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.4.1-2+deb11u